msgid "New idea from this feedback"
msgstr "Ide baru dari masukan ini"

#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
msgid "No board yet. Owners and admins create it."
msgstr "Belum ada papan. Pemilik dan admin yang membuatnya."

#: src/features/roadmap/IdeaPane.tsx
msgid "No feedback is linked yet. Open a piece of feedback and use Link to an idea."
msgstr "Belum ada masukan yang terhubung. Buka sebuah masukan dan gunakan “Hubungkan ke ide”."

#: src/features/roadmap/LinkIdeaDialog.tsx
msgid "No idea matches."
msgstr "Tidak ada ide yang cocok."

#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
msgid "No inbox to show a board for."
msgstr "Tidak ada kotak masuk untuk menampilkan papan."

#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "On: anyone with the address reads the board, and signed-in readers vote and suggest ideas. Off: only your team sees it, as a tool to sort feedback."
msgstr "Aktif: siapa pun yang memiliki alamatnya membaca papan, dan pembaca yang masuk memberi suara serta mengusulkan ide. Nonaktif: hanya tim Anda yang melihatnya, sebagai alat untuk memilah masukan."

#: src/features/roadmap/IdeaPane.tsx
msgid "One reply, written once, goes to every open feedback conversation linked to this idea, as you, on each conversation’s own channel."
msgstr "Satu balasan, ditulis sekali, dikirim ke setiap percakapan masukan terbuka yang terhubung ke ide ini, atas nama Anda, lewat saluran masing-masing percakapan."

#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Terbuka"

#: src/features/roadmap/IdeaPane.tsx
msgid "Open on the public board"
msgstr "Buka di papan publik"

#: src/features/roadmap/LinkIdeaDialog.tsx
msgid "Pick an idea of this inbox’s board"
msgstr "Pilih ide dari papan kotak masuk ini"

#: src/features/roadmap/MoveDialog.tsx
msgid "Posted as your public reply on the idea. Markdown works."
msgstr "Diposting sebagai balasan publik Anda pada ide. Markdown didukung."

#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
msgid "Private"
msgstr "Privat"

#: src/features/roadmap/pages.tsx
msgid "Private, only your team sees it"
msgstr "Privat, hanya tim Anda yang melihatnya"

#: src/features/roadmap/pages.tsx
#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Publik"

#: src/features/roadmap/IdeaPane.tsx
msgid "Public page"
msgstr "Halaman publik"

#: src/features/roadmap/Settings.tsx
msgid "Readers cannot suggest ideas. Votes and replies still work."
msgstr "Pembaca tidak dapat mengusulkan ide. Suara dan balasan tetap berfungsi."

#: src/features/roadmap/pages.tsx
#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
msgid "Roadmap"
msgstr "Peta jalan"

#: src/features/roadmap/RoadmapColumn.tsx
